# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from data/forever and tools/lib/professions/gathering. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/herbalism
title Herbalism 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# Herbalism 1-300 for both factions: loops through the densest skill-up herbs
# for each skill band (expected skill-ups per yard walked), with rank training.
# Skill needed per herb: see tools/lib/professions/gathering/tables.js
# (Peacebloom and Silverleaf 1 ... Black Lotus 300).
#
# Spawns, trainers and vendors come from the Era baseline (pfQuest); recipes and
# their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`profession build`).
# Nothing confirms the spawns' 10-60 placement on Forever yet: refine with
# Polestar_Recorder sessions. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine
# converts them where Forever changed a map frame.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

step Learn Herbalism
  tip Any Herbalism trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Herbalism (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest.
  level 5
  train Herbalism Apprentice

